      "originalText": "BoE\n\nEvent triggered\n80 QPS\n\nBulk\n320 * 40 * 10 ^ 6\n~ 100 * 100 * 10 ^ 6\n~ 10 ^ 10\n~ 10 billion per second",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
